        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Effective November 21, 1993 through October 22, 2005, the Company and Union agree to establish a ten-hour, four-day week. The terms of this agreement shall take precedence over the principal agreement between the parties. This Memorandum of Agreement shall continue in force from year to year thereafter until terminated by either party serving thirty (30) days' written notice to the other party.",
            "block_bbox": [
                176,
                458,
                1059,
                628
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    176.0,
                    458.0
                ],
                [
                    1059.0,
                    458.0
                ],
                [
                    1059.0,
                    628.0
                ],
                [
                    176.0,
                    628.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. The Company shall select the employees and locations that are subject to the ten-hour, four-day week.",
            "block_bbox": [
                177,
                651,
                1036,
                709
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    177.0,
                    651.0
                ],
                [
                    1036.0,
                    651.0
                ],
                [
                    1036.0,
                    709.0
                ],
                [
                    177.0,
                    709.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. A scheduled tour on a ten-hour, four day week schedule shall consist of not more than ten (10) consecutive hours exclusive of a meal period. Meal periods of less than 1/2 hour shall be included as part of the tour.",
            "block_bbox": [
                173,
                734,
                1037,
                821
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    173.0,
                    734.0
                ],
                [
                    1037.0,
                    734.0
                ],
                [
                    1037.0,
                    821.0
                ],
                [
                    173.0,
                    821.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. The tour (four-tens) will not be subject to overtime for the hours worked in excess of eight (8) in any one day. Hours worked in excess of ten (10) in any one day or forty (40) in any one week shall be paid at the overtime rate.",
            "block_bbox": [
                173,
                845,
                1054,
                957
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 10,
            "group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    173.0,
                    845.0
                ],
                [
                    1054.0,
                    845.0
                ],
                [
                    1054.0,
                    957.0
                ],
                [
                    173.0,
                    957.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. Payment for excused absence as provided in Articles 12 and 13 will be based on up to ten (10) hours per day rather than eight (8). Sickness disability will be paid on the basis of ten (10) hours.",
            "block_bbox": [
                170,
                983,
                1026,
                1068
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 11,
            "group_id": 10,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    170.0,
                    983.0
                ],
                [
                    1026.0,
                    983.0
                ],
                [
                    1026.0,
                    1068.0
                ],
                [
                    170.0,
                    1068.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5. Employees scheduled for ten-hour tours shall in no case receive in excess of forty (40) hours' vacation pay per week or shall not gain an advantage over employees working eight-hour tours.",
            "block_bbox": [
                171,
                1093,
                1004,
                1179
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
            "block_order": 12,
            "group_id": 11,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    171.0,
                    1093.0
                ],
                [
                    1004.0,
                    1093.0
                ],
                [
                    1004.0,
                    1179.0
                ],
                [
                    171.0,
                    1179.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "6. Weeks which contain a recognized holiday (except personal holidays) may be scheduled on the basis of five eight-hour tours or four ten-hour tours. With supervisory approval employees scheduled for four ten-hour tours may be permitted to make-up time to 40 hours in the week.",
            "block_bbox": [
                170,
                1203,
                1040,
                1317
            ],
            "block_id": 12,
            "block_order": 13,
            "group_id": 12,
